{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts in South Derbyshire","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"In South Derbyshire:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"1.9","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in South Derbyshire was below the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"55%","note":"","content":"<p>In Derbyshire and Nottinghamshire, an average proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"82%","note":"","content":"<p>A higher proportion of health and social care job adverts in Derbyshire and Nottinghamshire could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were fewer online job adverts than the UK average in South Derbyshire","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts in South Derbyshire rose to 1.8 per 100 working-age residents (aged 16 to 64 years), from 1.3 adverts in August 2023. </p><p>This was lower than the UK average of 3.4 adverts per 100 working-age residents in August 2024. </p>"},{"id":"linechart","type":"Chart","chartType":"line","title":"Trends in job adverts","subtitle":"Trends in job adverts per 100 working-age residents in South Derbyshire, June 2017 to August 2024","footer":"Source: Textkernel, Office for National Statistics","data":[{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.838939239},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":2.096310952},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":2.168432474},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":2.098624585},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.743362267},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":1.4547964},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":1.518381414},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":1.71391997},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":1.71391997},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":1.6613724},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.839243947},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-04-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.868401922},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.933592515},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.916050319},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.977448006},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.891080346},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.985349896},{"z":"South Derbyshire","x":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":1.953347241},{"z":"South Derbyshire"